  designNotes: "2026-08-29, user request (Meshy_AI_Man_in_Black_at_the_P_biped '_biped
    (1).zip', 'Scene' take, 3.07s, Humanoid retarget onto \u5C41\u5B69\u738B). Jumping
    overhead double-hand smash. Measured offline via clip.SampleAnimation on the
    live x1.5 PiHaiWangV2 rig. Clip has a LARGE baked forward travel (root ~4m over
    t=0-0.6); import is motion-EXTRACTED / useRootMotion=0 (shipped-attack pattern)
    so the body animates in place and that reach is NOT at the boss transform. Wired
    window t=0.50-0.60: both hands sweep DOWN Y 2.6->1.4 at v8-10 through the player
    hurtbox. In-place forward reach ~0.15m local -> maxDistance conservative 1.3
    (boss must be point-blank). FULL leap+reach = useRootMotion=1 (window ~0.1-0.65)
    + clear _currentAttack on LeapSlam/Breakdance interrupt (CHANGELOG 'root-motion
    attack trap') - follow-up, per DoubleCombo/ChargeCut precedent. First-pass: 30
    HP / 24 poise / knockback 7 / launches / cooldown 6 / major. m_Speed 1.25.\n\n2026-08-29
    follow-up (\u4F7F\u7528\u8005:\u300C\u9019\u5169\u62DB\u61C9\u8A72\u90FD\u662F\u6709\u4F4D\u79FB\u7684
    \u76EE\u524D\u6C92\u770B\u5230\u300D): useRootMotion=1. BossAnimatorRootMotionRelay
    on \u5C41\u5B69\u738B/Visual (empty OnAnimatorMove + applyRootMotion=1) makes
    Animator.deltaPosition valid; ApplyMotion also gated on CurrentState==Attack
    (root-motion trap fix); deltaPosition.y zeroed. rm window 0.05-0.60. Distances/windows
    first-pass, user tunes.\n\n2026-08-29 (\u4F7F\u7528\u8005:\u300C\u8209\u96D9\u624B\u7F6E\u9802\u90A3\u62DB
    \u98DB\u9AD8\u4E00\u9EDE,\u653B\u64CA\u524D\u5148\u9396\u5B9A\u73A9\u5BB6,\u89F8\u767C\u6642\u5F80\u73A9\u5BB6\u65B9\u5411\u5782\u76F4\u767C\u8D77\u653B\u64CA\u300D):
    re-wired as \u5C41\u5B69\u738B's leapSlamAttack (was a normalAttackPool entry).
    Now uses the LeapSlamWindup+LeapSlam state machine: 1s windup facing/locking
    the player, then a scripted height arc (PW2_Tuning.LeapSlamExtraHeight, lowered
    30->8 for \u5C41\u5B69\u738B's ~2.5m scale) with mid-air homing toward the player
    until LeapSlamTrackUntilNormalized (0.45), then a committed vertical drop. useRootMotion
    back OFF (LeapSlam owns position). hitWindows moved to 0.42-0.60 (the descent+landing,
    height arc fallEnd nt 0.53) on LeftHand+RightHand (no LandingAOE hitbox on \u5C41\u5B69\u738B
    - the overhead-hands slam uses the hand hitboxes). Timer-triggered every LeapSlamTriggerSeconds
    (20). AnimatorState m_Speed dropped 1.25->1.0 for air-time readability.\n\n2026-08-29
    (使用者:「飛向天空那招沒有鎖定玩家方向飛過去攻擊
    傷害固定百分比 50」): PW2_Tuning.leapSlamTeleportToLanding=0
    so CommitLeapSlamLanding NO LONGER blinks to the player - it only locks facing/
    landing-Y and the airborne homing flies the boss there (real pounce). Damage:
    healthDamageIsPercentOfTargetMax=1 + baseHealthDamage 30->50 (fixed 50% of player
    max HP). hitWindows collapsed 2->1 (LeftHand only) so the two hand hitboxes can't
    each deal 50% for a 100% instakill - one window, one 50% hit. 武士 keeps
    leapSlamTeleportToLanding=1 (unchanged)."
